\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1. Look at the Love of Jesus,
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  and try to see so clear.
\par  He died on Mount. Golgatha
\par  To save us all mankind.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  O Sinner, O my brother
\par  How wonderful it is?
\par  The Lord of Host by Himself
\par  Came as a slave to us.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Yes, it is so wonderful,
\par You deserve praise and thanks,
\par My Master and Jesus Christ,
\par The Master of all things
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Have mercy on a poor soul,
\par And let me sing you songs
\par In all my life on this earth
\par \pard     And by your throne on High.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

